{
  "engine": "kas-bundle",
  "provenance": "recorded: Kiro's agent service @kiro/agent 0.66.104 (the pinned bundle Station installs), launched as Station's kiro-kas-bundle descriptor does (`--experimental-wasm-modules <script> --transport=stdio --auth=acp-callback`) in an empty HOME with no sign-in, 2026-11-13. initialize, its requests before answering, and session/new modes and configOptions. Every _kiro/auth/getAccessToken was refused with Station's signed-out answer; initialize and session/new still succeeded. Scrubbed: log and workspace paths, session id.",
